Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Dump: DumpScreen becomes DumpPage, the route shapes
 through toDumpPageProps

The route's inline unwrapping of the feed read and its current-week
periodKey move into the pure adapter toDumpPageProps (utils/dump.ts, unit
tested), which the dump scenarios run on their fixtures too. DumpScreen is
renamed DumpPage and provides DumpPageContext: the composer reads capture
and captureError, the feed reads loadMore, instead of callback props.

